{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"INCIDENT UPDATE — scanner-integration is a HARD LOCK; fix requires a human force-submit.\n\nDEFINITIVE ROOT CAUSE (gerrit-verify.yaml `vote` aggregate, ~lines 483-506):\nThe Verified conclusion is forced to 'failure' unless EXACTLY ONE route completes.\nThere are only two routes: docs-only and full. Any code/workflow change is full-route,\nand the full-route branch requires `needs.scanner-integration.result == 'success'`. The\nscanner-integration contract step has a latent failure, so it casts Verified -1 on EVERY\nfull-route change. Therefore NO full-route change can earn an organic Verified +1 while\nmain requires scanner-integration. 2600 and 2612 could only have LANDED via human\nforce-submit.\n\nCONSEQUENCE: The fix itself (revert OR de-gate) is a full-route change, so it faces the\nSAME lock and cannot self-validate. Breaking the lock requires ONE human force-submit\n(admin past Verified -1). Agents must not force — escalating to the operator.\n\nTWO FIX OPTIONS PREPARED FOR FORCE-SUBMIT:\n1. De-gate (Gerrit 2617, WIP) — RECOMMENDED. Removes scanner-integration from the vote\n   aggregate's `needs` + both route conditions; the job STILL RUNS on full route\n   (advisory), so WS5 real-gitleaks contracts keep executing and aa9e's Dockerfile\n   hardening + tests are preserved. Clears the review-bot's revert objections. Fixes the\n   lock for ALL future changes after one force-submit. Trivially reversible (re-gate once\n   contracts are green under b973). Validated: YAML + actionlint pass.\n2. Full revert (Gerrit 2616) — removes aa9e entirely. BLOCKED by review-bot LLM-Review -1\n   (reintroduces unpinned gitleaks/semgrep + drops secret-detection contracts). Not\n   recommended.\n\nBoth need the operator's force-submit; nothing lands autonomously. 2617 is parked WIP so\nthe review-bot reviews it overnight — its LLM-Review vote will be visible by morning.\n\nCI_RESULT: {\"run_id\":\"gerrit-2617-pending\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"failure_type\":\"build-failure\",\"failure_details\":\"scanner-integration contract step fails on every full-route change; root cause is a required-job self-validation lock (vacuous introducing vote) + latent contract failure\",\"fixes_applied\":[\"de-gate scanner-integration to advisory in vote aggregate (Gerrit 2617, WIP)\"],\"retry_count\":0}"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788507824855016730,"uuid":"3ee32821-4cfe-4758-80ec-a07b431165ac"}